ity, no iOS auto-zoom)\r\n- Accessible link underlines, focus rings, `prefers-reduced-motion`\r\n- ARIA roles on status boxes, `<main>` landmark, semantic `<footer>`\r\n- Styled buttons with 44px min touch target\r\n- Registration confirm uses table layout for device details\r\n- Logo SVG viewBox tightened for proper left-alignment\r\n- All component colours via CSS variables for theme adaptation\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"01_success_light\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd037770-1aca-4788-a01a-ffd41269eca2\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"01_success_dark\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08fb0e32-6da2-490b-a2a0-4f013f62cb56\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"02_error_forbidden_light\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f3fd234-f00c-4593-88e9-581aec42908d\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"02_error_forbidden_dark\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79e921fb-e594-4ed7-b99c-00104836b356\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"03_error_expired_light\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09975c55-790b-422a-9978-114857fca6a1\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"03_error_expired_dark\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61060de2-54a1-4273-9257-60b60a53042c\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"04_error_internal_light\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca240bd9-b11d-4ba8-932e-f83c4f0765ce\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"04_error_internal_dark\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/577b75a3-7084-4314-8290-5a101665b7e7\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"05_auth_web_light\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6ce22c6-6cd7-4712-a9fe-6732b459bb7d\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"900\" alt=\"05_auth_web_dark\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cdf2042-7905-41b5-8d2c-93b4151a7a39\" />\r\n<img width=\"1